SUMMARY:Interchange Message: EARL'S COURT STATION: Until the end of service
  on Thursday 5 November\, there will be no step-free access to/from the 
 westbound District line. If you are starting a westbound step-free journey
  at Earl's Court\, take an eastbound District line train to Victoria and 
 change there for a westbound train. To complete a westbound step-free 
 journey at Earl's Court\, take an Ealing Broadway or Richmond train to 
 Hammersmith and change there for an eastbound train back to Earl's Court.
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR